I just lost another character after meeting Rodney.  I was playing a
wizard this time.  I haven't made it this far in a long time.  But just
like the last few times I got this far, it seems like the game changes
when Rodney appears.

What I mean is that the monsters seem to be faster.  The monsters seem
to be able to do more damage.  My attacks seem to have no effect.

I'd not really had any problems before.  I'd been surrounded by
monsters conjured by L's yet had no real difficulty breaking through.
My magic missile and +6 staff made mince meat of the bad guys.

Yet when Rodney appears, it seems that I just can't break through.  My
attacks seem to have no effect on them or him.  Death wands wouldn't
kill him.

I know this is just an illusion.  It's just frustrating though.  I have
ascended three times.  But the last time was well over a year ago.
Since then, the handful of times I've reached the endgame, either
waking up Rodney or even making it all the way to the Astral Plane, I
just get worn done by all the monsters.

Oh well, on to the next game ...

